#     `@misc` block with `author={fanat503}` and `url={.../fanat503/rope-attribution}`,
#     but the same file also contains `git config user.name "fanat503"` in one
#     place and `user.name = "Vitebsk Research"` in another. Two conflicting
#     candidates, neither authoritative -> guessing would be worse than a gap.
#
# ACTION REQUIRED before tagging a release or publishing:
